    "title": "Bills vs. Chargers predictions: Buffalo's offense may dominate in Week 3 - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Matt Byham ,\n21 hours ago Josh Allen and the Buffalo Bills’ well-positioned to dismantle the struggling Los Angeles Chargers in Week 3. The Buffalo Bills are on a heater right now, with quarterback Josh Allen playing incredible football at a clip that has him as the current odds-on favorite to win NFL MVP honors for the 2026 NFL season. Now 2-0 and with impressive offensive showings against both the Houston Texans and Detroit Lions, the Bills are set to welcome the woebegone Los Angeles Chargers to cozy Highmark Stadium. Read full article",
